{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1556850-mortal-fronts-for-changeling-courts","id":1556850,"title":"Mortal Fronts for Changeling Courts.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2025-12-20T01:54:09-08:00","id":1556850,"title":"Mortal Fronts for Changeling Courts.","content":"I have recently fleshed out my Changeling Courts with the help of Google AI and I was wondering if anyone on the Forum would be interested in giving me some feedback on them? I will start out with my Spring Court which I have as a collection of 10 Collaborative mundane fronts. <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">If you all are interested in reading more I will share my other three, but this is the one I think works the best to Illustrate the Spring Court Values.<br /> <br /> Mundane Fronts for the Spring Court</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">The Green Man's Garden: An Enchanted Venue &amp; Hub</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">The &quot;Green Man's Garden&quot; is the central hub and primary venue. It is a botanical garden and outdoor venue marketed explicitly for unique, fantasy-themed weddings and events. The on-site location of the florist and apothecary allows for seamless cross-promotion and integrated sourcing of natural, fae-touched ingredients.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Color Scheme: Sage Green, Cream/Off-White, Blush Pink/Soft Peach, Natural Terracotta, Moss Green/Deep Emerald</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">The Keeper and High Management</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Green Jack (Spring King)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Green Man, Elemental Seeming, Woodblood Kith, British Isles)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: As the Hearty Keeper of the Grove, Jack favors well-worn linen shirts in Moss Green, Terracotta work trousers, and a battered straw hat. He wears a subtle &quot;Green Man&quot; pendant that clients perceive as an authentic pagan touch.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: He consistently smells of damp soil and fresh herbs. His skin possesses a perpetual rugged tan, though vine-like patterns are occasionally visible on his forearms.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: As the Owner and Keeper of the Sacred Grove, he oversees all maintenance and sells the authenticity of the location during client tours.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: As the Monarch of the Spring Court, he manages the domain and promotes vitality. His Woodblood Blessing ensures that when he uses Survival to navigate or cultivate the garden, achieving three successes counts as an exceptional success. He utilizes his Fade into the Foliage ability to monitor the garden in secret or hold discreet court meetings among the overgrown hedges.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: He is a towering figure crafted from living wood and vibrant leaves. His skin is rough bark, his hair is a cascade of foliage, and his eyes glow with the vital energy of the spring season.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Stewards of the Grove</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Little Oaken Annie</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Dryad, Fairest Seeming, Woodblood Kith, Greek)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: Annie embodies a Whimsical Prairie style, wearing flowy Blush-Pink prairie dresses and carrying a hand-woven basket. She wears a gold olive branch hairpin as a nod to her Greek roots.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: Her hair is perpetually coiffed with wild blossoms that never wilt. She carries a faint, sweet scent of honeysuckle and oak bark.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: As the Horticulturalist and Event Planner Assistant, she coordinates the garden's blooms with client needs and ensures every event feels magically homespun.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: Serving as the Court\u2019s Muse and Liaison, she uses her Woodblood Blessing to achieve exceptional successes on Survival rolls while foraging for court components. She employs her Fade into the Foliage ability to eavesdrop on sensitive conversations or protect secret meeting spots near the gazebo.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: She possesses a graceful mien with skin the color of smooth oak bark. Her hair is composed of fine leaves and twigs that sway as if moved by a soft breeze.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Lesnoi Dedushka</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Leshy, Beast Seeming, Woodblood Kith, Slavic)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: Representing Wild and Ancient Security, he wears sturdy woolens in Deep Emerald and Terracotta. He carries a gnarled walking staff and a hand-carved Slavic forest spirit talisman.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: He walks with a pronounced limp that makes him seem like a harmless groundskeeper. His deep green eyes track movement with the precision of a predator.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: As the Head of Grounds Security, he handles vandalism and intrusive threats without involving mundane police.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: As the Guardian of the Wilds, he protects the Court\u2019s territory. His Woodblood Blessing allows him to expertly navigate the terrain with exceptional ease, while his Fade into the Foliage ability allows him to ambush intruders effectively from within the boundary thickets.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: He is a gnarled figure made of twisted tree roots and ancient moss. His lower body ends in sturdy, cloven goat legs, and his eyes glow green in the darkness.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Bjork Birchwood</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Radande, Fairest Seeming, Woodblood Kith, Norse)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: She maintains a Clean and Airy Pastoral style, favoring crisp Cream linen blouses and Sage Green skirts. She wears a silver Yggdrasil pendant as a thematic accessory.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: Her pale complexion features horizontal lines resembling birch bark. She moves with an unnaturally light step that barely disturbs the grass.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: As the Head Tour Guide and Public Relations Manager, she serves as the welcoming public face of the garden.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: As the Court\u2019s Diplomat, she handles outward-facing interactions. Her Woodblood Blessing provides her with exceptional insights when navigating the garden's natural paths, and her Fade into the Foliage ability allows her to disappear into a suitable birch tree to participate in discreet meetings.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: She is an impossibly slender figure with smooth white skin marked by black horizontal lines. Her hair consists of delicate green leaves that shift color with the seasons.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">The Emerald Bloom: A Community Foraging Collective &amp; Florist</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">&quot;The Emerald Bloom&quot; is a charming community flower shop and foraging collective in a vibrant Chicago neighborhood. The business specializes in ethically &quot;wildcrafted&quot; bouquets, herbal arrangements, and sustainable gardening workshops.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Color Scheme: Sage Green, Moss Green, Terracotta, Rust Orange, Creamy Ivory, Oatmeal, Blush Pink/Soft Peach</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Proprietor and Lead Forager</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Flower Child</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Anthousa, Fairest Seeming, Flowering Kith, Greek)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: This Whimsical Forager wears Oatmeal linen dresses and a wide-brimmed straw hat. She often wears a gold poppy pin on her lapel, a nod to ancient Greek floral motifs.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: She has an unusually rosy complexion and perpetually smells of fresh flowers. She often leaves a faint trail of sweet-smelling pollen on surfaces she touches.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Studio Role: As the Head Florist and Community Workshop Organizer, she runs workshops on flower pressing and natural dyes.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: Serving as the Community Liaison, her Flowering Blessing ensures that when she uses Socialize to convince others of her necessity, three successes count as an exceptional success. She uses her Seductive Fragrance ability to build immediate goodwill and make potential allies feel invested in her presence.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: She is a vibrant figure with skin like soft petals in hues of Blush Pink. Her hair is a cascade of seasonal blooms that flower perpetually.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Logistics and Sourcing Specialist</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Heather Pixie</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Pixie, Fairest Seeming, Airtouched Kith, British Isles)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: Her Practical Pixie look consists of Terracotta work trousers and a Moss Green utility vest. She carries a hand-carved wooden acorn charm tied to her belt loop.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: She is unusually nimble and moves without a sound. She tends to leave a faint, sparkling residue on surfaces when moving quickly.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Studio Role: As the Delivery and Gardens Assistant, she manages the logistics of sourcing materials and delivering arrangements quickly and efficiently.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: Acting as a Scout and Courier, her Airtouched Blessing allows her to achieve exceptional success easily when climbing or moving vertically. She utilizes The Drift ability to move across fragile or unstable surfaces without leaving a trace.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: She is a delicate figure of average height with large, shimmering insectoid wings. She seems to float more than walk, leaving no footprints behind.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Herb\u2019s Herbs Apothecary and Tea Room: Bespoke Potions &amp; Favors</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">&quot;Herb\u2019s Herbs Apothecary and Tea Room&quot; positions itself as the source for bespoke wedding favors and signature drink ingredients for fantasy-themed events.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Color Scheme: Deep Walnut Brown, Moss Green, Forest Green, Cream, Parchment, Deep Plum/Aubergine</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Proprietor and Master Alchemist </span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Hemlock Herb</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Waldgeist, Elemental Seeming, Veneficus Kith, German)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: The Alchemist Proprietor wears tweed vests over linen shirts and an iron oak leaf charm. His style blends German forest folklore with practical business attire.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: His skin feels like rough bark to the touch. His eyes are a striking, deep green that clients often mistake for colored contacts.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Apothecary Role: As the Owner and Alchemist, he manages the shop and specializes in creating unique wedding favors and signature cocktail ingredients.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: As the Court Alchemist, his Veneficus Blessing allows him to achieve exceptional success when using Survival to identify Goblin fruits. He leverages his Waste Not, Want Not ability to instantly make toxic plants edible for use in his powerful concoctions.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: He is a powerful figure with bark-like skin and glowing green embers for eyes. Small mushrooms and moss grow in the crevices of his form, and subtle branches can extend from his body.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Emerald Dawn Event Planning: The Glimmerwood Collective</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">&quot;Emerald Dawn Event Planning&quot; is a bespoke event planning agency in Chicago specializing exclusively in Fantasy-Themed Weddings and Events.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Aesthetic &amp; Color Scheme: Emerald Green, Forest Green, Creamy Ivory, Oatmeal, Burnished Gold, Brass, Blush Pink, White</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Director and Lead Visionary</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Luminous Lena</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Light Elf, Fairest Seeming, Bright One Kith, Norse)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: Lena favors flowing silk and linen gowns in Champagne or Pale Gold with jewelry resembling twisting vines. She wears a silver brooch depicting a radiant sun as a nod to her Norse heritage.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: Her skin is flawless and luminous even in deep shadow. People often feel a spontaneous surge of optimism when standing in her presence.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Agency Role: As the CEO and Fantasy Design Visionary, she manages high-profile clients and sells extravagant immersive designs.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: Serving as the Court\u2019s Emissary, her Bright One Blessing ensures that when she uses Socialize to be the center of attention, she achieves exceptional success with only three successes. She uses her Flare ability to dramatically emphasize her powerful presence or blind enemies during confrontations.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: She is a tall, ethereal figure who glows with soft internal light. Her hair appears to be woven with strands of pure, soft sunlight.</span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Logistics and Field Operatives</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Manny Bush</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Hare Spirit, Beast Seeming, Flickerflash Kith, Native American)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: This Urban Forager wears durable Earthy Browns and carries a worn leather satchel adorned with hand-carved wooden charms.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: He is perpetually twitchy, particularly his nose and ears. He can run at incredible speeds when necessary.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Agency Role: As the Head of Logistics and &quot;Quest Runner,&quot; he ensures the rapid, last-minute transport of essential, unique items for event setups.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: Acting as a Courier and Scout, his Flickerflash Blessing provides exceptional success during chases. He leverages his Instantaneous Velocity ability to triple his speed, allowing him to bypass any mundane obstacle or outrun threats.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: He is a humanoid figure with the long ears and powerful hind legs of a hare, covered in soft brown and white fur, moving in silent bounds.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Swanhilda</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Swan Maiden, Fairest Seeming, Airtouched Kith, German)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: Her Pastoral Grace look includes layered garments in muted teal and soft gray. She wears a simple silver armband with a subtle swan motif etched into it.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: She has an unusually long neck and a pristine, dancer-like posture. Her hair remains perfectly in place even in high winds.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Agency Role: As the On-Site Setup and Immersive Decor Specialist, she manages the delicate work of setting up intricate fantasy d\u00e9cor elements in difficult locations.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: As an Infiltration Expert, her Airtouched Blessing grants her exceptional success on vertical movement rolls. She uses The Drift ability to move across fragile surfaces without leaving a trace while gathering information or delivering sensitive materials for the Court.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: She is a figure of exquisite grace with large, powerful feathered wings that can fold seamlessly into her form.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Robin Whistling Bird</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Robin Spirit, Beast Seeming, Airtouched Kith, Native American)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: Robin's look is built around Terracotta Orange and Deep Forest Green. He wears a tweed flat cap with a small feather detail that clients perceive as charming.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: He possesses an uncanny knack for whistling complex tunes and tilts his head like a bird when listening intently.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Agency Role: As a Watcher and Aerial Photographer, he assists with setup and uses his agility for tasks that require vertical movement.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: Serving as an Aerial Scout, his Airtouched Blessing facilitates exceptional vertical movement. He leverages The Drift ability to land silently on high wires or fragile rooftops to provide surveillance and unique perspectives for the Court.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: He is a smaller-than-average humanoid covered in soft brown feathers. He possesses a small, sharp beak and functional wings in place of arms.</span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Spring Sky Photography: The Wildwood Shutter</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">&quot;The Wildwood Shutter&quot; is a photography collective specializing in capturing intimate moments using natural light and scenic backdrops for fantasy-themed weddings and events.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Color Scheme: Moss Green, Cream, Brown</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">The Visionary Eye and Lead Photographer</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Valr the Falcon</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Falcon Spirit, Beast Seeming, Airtouched Kith, Norse)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: Valr favors a Nostalgic Adventurer look, wearing tweed vests and sturdy work trousers. He uses a vintage leather camera harness and a silver ring etched with a falcon motif.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: He possesses incredibly sharp eyesight and is unnervingly good at climbing high objects quickly.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Studio Role: As the Lead Photographer and Location Scout, he captures unique angles in natural settings by climbing trees or structures.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: Serving as an Intelligence Gatherer, his Airtouched Blessing grants him exceptional success when climbing to vantage points. He uses The Drift ability to silently balance on fragile surfaces or high vantage points while observing potential threats.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: He is a lean, muscular mien with bright, sharp eyes and subtle brown feathers. He has powerful wings and sharp talons on his hands and feet.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Winddancer Studios: Folk Dance Troupe &amp; Entertainment</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">&quot;Winddancer Studios&quot; is an exclusive entertainment agency in Chicago specializing in authentic folk dance choreography and performances for upscale, themed weddings and events.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Color Scheme: Forest Green, Moss Green, Burnished Gold/Brass, Creamy Ivory, White, Deep Aubergine/Plum, Terracotta</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Proprietor and Lead Choreographer</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Celeste Winddancer</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Sylph, Elemental Seeming, Airtouched Kith, Gaulish Celt/French)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: This Ethereal Choreographer wears tailored linen tunics in Creamy Ivory and a brass torc as a statement piece.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: She has an incredibly light step and her hair seems to float around her face regardless of the weather.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Studio Role: As the Owner and Head Choreographer, she designs bespoke performances and manages high-end client relations.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: As the Domain Architect, her Airtouched Blessing ensures exceptional success on vertical movement rolls. She leverages The Drift ability to move across complex or fragile environments silently while performing inspections or rapid movement.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: She is a slender, misty figure who seems to constantly float just above the ground, moving with weightless speed.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Troupe Instructors and Harvesters</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Vesna</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Samodiva, Fairest Seeming, Airtouched Kith, Slavic)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: This Folkloric Muse wears flowing skirts in Deep Aubergine and traditional red woolen thread bracelets on her wrist.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: She possesses astonishing grace and can balance in precarious positions. She leaves an earthy scent of wild herbs when she moves quickly.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Studio Role: As the Dance Captain and Head Instructor, she teaches traditional dances to the troupe and clients.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: Serving as the Artistic Director, her Airtouched Blessing facilitates exceptional athletic feats. She uses The Drift ability to perform gravity-defying leaps during performances that maximize Glamour generation and inspire wonder.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: She is a wild-looking mien with hair like a waterfall of leaves. Her form appears to move with gravity-defying grace and weightlessness.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Dyani the Deer Woman</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Deer Woman, Fairest Seeming, Flickerflash Kith, Native American)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: Dyani manages logistics in practical charcoal linen trousers and carries a leather messenger bag with gold clasps. She wears a simple bone or antler carving necklace.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: She has an intense, wide-eyed stare and an uncanny ability to navigate dense crowds with impossible speed. Her feet sometimes make a subtle clicking sound.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Studio Role: As the Business and Logistics Manager, she handles the fast-paced scheduling, gig management, and accounting for the dance troupe.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: Acting as a Scout, her Flickerflash Blessing provides exceptional success during chases. She utilizes Instantaneous Velocity to triple her speed and react to urban threats across the city faster than any vehicle.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: She is a beautiful woman from the waist up with the powerful, cloven-hoofed legs of a deer and small antlers sprouting from her head.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">The Whispering Willows Band: Evocative Music &amp; Glamour Harvest</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">&quot;The Whispering Willows&quot; is a musical band specializing in evocative, emotional music for the fantasy-themed wedding and event niche.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Color Scheme: Midnight Blue, Moss Green, Burnished Silver, Deep Aubergine/Plum, Ivory</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Lead Vocalist and Frontwoman </span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Vila Clara</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Vila, Elemental Seeming, Nightsinger Kith, Slavic)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: Clara wears custom-designed gowns in Midnight Blue and a woven ribbon with traditional Slavic embroidery patterns. Her stage presence is ethereal and captivating.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: Her voice carries perfectly over any noise and always remains clear. She possesses a faint, floral scent that seems to radiate from her skin.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Band Role: As the Lead Vocalist and Frontwoman, she serves as the primary performer for all major fantasy events.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: Serving as a Lead Harvester, her Nightsinger Blessing grants her exceptional success when singing or composing. She leverages her Siren Song ability to captivate audiences and potential allies, rooting them to the spot with her unearthly, perfect voice.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: She is an otherworldly beauty with hair woven from moonlight and mist. She can sprout large feathered wings when her powers are active, and her voice is truly unnatural in its captivating quality.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Composers and Technicians</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Silvanus</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Satyr, Beast Seeming, Artist Kith, Greek)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: This Bohemian Wanderer wears Moss Green linen shirts and a worn leather vest. He wears a simple leather thong necklace with a small silver coin charm.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: He has unusually agile fingers and hair that always appears slightly unkempt, resembling wild vines.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Band Role: He serves as the Main Composer and Lead Pan Flutist, a position in which he uses the haunting melodies of his pipes to define the emotional atmosphere of the band's performances.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: Serving as a Morale Officer, his Artist Blessing ensures exceptional success when using his pan flute specialty. He utilizes Tools of the Trade to always have the perfect instrument on hand to inspire deep emotion and Glamour in his listeners.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: He is a lithe figure with the horns, tail, and powerful goat legs of a satyr, moving with wild, unpredictable agility.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Alfred the Lutin</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Lutin, Wizened Seeming, Artist Kith, French)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: Alfred is a Dapper Technician who wears Ivory linen shirts and a Moss Green waistcoat with a brass fleur-de-lis pin.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: His hands are perpetually stained with wood oil and polish. He is highly focused on technical details and moves with surprising technical efficiency.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Band Role: He serves as the Lute Player and the primary Instrument Technician for the band.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: As a Logistics Expert, his Artist Blessing provides exceptional success when crafting or repairing instruments. He leverages Tools of the Trade to instantly produce any necessary implements for complex repairs or technical needs for the Court.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: He is a short, wizened mien with a large nose and intelligent eyes, often appearing in a tiny leather apron as he moves with efficient, jerky movements.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">The What Ales You Inn: Cozy Brews &amp; Camaraderie</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">&quot;The What Ales You Inn&quot; is a cozy inn and pub in Chicago that serves as a mundane front for the Spring Court.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Color Scheme: Deep Walnut Brown, Deep Forest Green, Cream, Moss Green, Polished Brass</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Proprietor and Master of the Cask</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Jameson O\u2019Whiskey</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Clurichaun, Wizened Seeming, Absinthial Kith, British Isles)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: Jameson favors a Quaint Proprietor look, featuring a tweed waistcoat and a brass pocket watch. He wears an embroidered moss-green shamrock on his lapel.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: He is a master of hospitality with a perpetually rosy complexion. His beard is impeccably maintained and always looks perfectly groomed.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Inn Role: As the Owner, Innkeeper, and Head Brewer, he manages the facility and crafts the inn's unique ales and teas.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: Serving as a Provisioner, his Absinthial Blessing ensures exceptional success when crafting consumable fae ingredients. He uses the Green Fairy's Curse ability to paralyze intruders with intoxicating visions, ensuring the inn\u2019s internal security and the Court's discretion.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: He is a short, wizened mien resembling a leprechaun with pointed ears and a sharp, perpetually cheerful expression.</span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Irongut and Co. Catering: The Hearth &amp; Harvest Kitchen</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">&quot;The Hearth &amp; Harvest Kitchen&quot; is a catering company specializing in immersive feasts for fantasy-themed events.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Color Scheme: Forest Green, Cream, Terracotta, Deep Walnut Brown, Deep Plum</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Proprietor and Master Pitmaster</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Ogre, Ogre Seeming, Gristlegrinder Kith, French)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: This Hearty Woodsman wears thick wool tunics and a heavy oiled-canvas apron. He uses oversized tools that appear to be hand-forged, following French rustic culinary traditions.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: He possesses an immense, powerful build and a legendary appetite. His hands are iron-hard from years of working over open flames and fire-cooking.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Catering Role: He serves as the Owner and Head Chef, a position in which he masterminds the company's hearth-to-table culinary philosophy and implements traditional fire-cooking techniques.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: Serving as the Court\u2019s Executioner, his Gristlegrinder Blessing provides exceptional success when grappling targets with intent to consume them. He leverages his To Serve Man ability to efficiently dispose of evidence or threats by expanding his jaw and consuming them whole.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: He is a massive figure with skin like dark bruised iron or cold stone. He possesses incredible strength and a seemingly endless, void-like appetite.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Weave and Whimsy Bridal: The Gilded Thistle Atelier</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">&quot;The Gilded Thistle Atelier&quot; is a bespoke studio specializing in handcrafted wedding attire and fantasy costumes.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Color Scheme: Moss Green, Deep Plum, Oatmeal, Ivory</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Proprietor and Master of the Needle</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Heinz Hemstitch</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Heinzelmannchen, Wizened Seeming, Artist Kith, German)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: This Meticulous Artisan wears vintage-inspired professional attire and an Oatmeal linen apron. He wears a decorative Edelweiss flower pin on his lapel.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: He moves with quick, precise movements that seem almost robotic. His hands are covered in tiny needle pricks and callouses that never seem to fade.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Studio Role: As the Master Seamster and Head Designer, he oversees the creation of all bespoke bridal wear and handcrafted costumes.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: Serving as a specialized Supplier, his Artist Blessing grants him exceptional success on tailoring specialties. He leverages Tools of the Trade to instantly produce necessary implements for crafting customized, protective gear or specialized garments for Court members.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: He is a small mien with nimble, oversized hands. He stands below five feet tall and often wears a pointed cloth hat as part of his true form, appearing as an adept master of intricate crafts.</span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24961-darklander","name":"Darklander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-12-24T18:36:49-08:00","id":1556976,"title":"","content":"The descriptions are very good, not only to visualize, but to set the tone of the place.<br /> <br /> But I think it's too much and too little. Too many places and too little description of what they do in the story. It's a quick, superficial description of basic activities that don't really say why those places matter in a story, how those basic activities matter to the local Changelings, what conflicts or story seeds are there to be explored. And the number may even hinder you later as you locked yourself with ten established places that may not fit the city anymore as you develop the setting/chronicle.<br /> <br /> You could reduce to 3 or 4 places and increase word count. Use the AI to make several versions of each if you need ideas, but alone it won't make good plot hooks, even if it may help making evocative presentations for them. I'm working with AI too, but I have to say that if you want the tool to help you with quality, you also have to accept that it isn't there to reduce your workload, just change the process.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-12-25T01:12:31-08:00","id":1556980,"title":"","content":"I have taken your advise and I have consolidated the following to keep all vendors but cut down on the number of Venues. I have The Green Man' Garden consolidated with an Artisans Row consisting of the Gilded Thistle Bridal, The Emerald Bloom, and Herb's Herbs Apothecary all on the same grounds.<br /> Other consolidations include<br /> Event Planning + Photography<br /> Dance Studio + Band<br /> Inn + Catering<br /> <br /> So I have managed to cut it down from 10 to 5 while maintaining all services. Also I know this only addresses the number of Venues by reducing it from 10 to five and as for the lack of any deeper story elements, this all still currently in development. <br /> <br /> Thanks for the feedback though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24961,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24961-darklander","user":"Darklander","date":". 12-25-2025, 07:47 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24961-darklander","name":"Darklander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-12-26T17:18:24-08:00","id":1557015,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darklander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1556850-mortal-fronts-for-changeling-courts?p=1556980#post1556980\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thanks for the feedback though.</div> </div> </div> </div>You're welcome, this is a promising project, this kind of resource is always good to have around.<br /> <br /> Come back whenever you have a new draft, or just want some help or encouragement, even help with crafting prompts for Gemini to do what you want.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-12-27T03:21:42-08:00","id":1557039,"title":"","content":"Would you be interested in my other Courts and their mundane covers? Also, do you consolidating it down helped?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24961,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24961-darklander","user":"Darklander","date":". 12-27-2025, 06:23 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24961-darklander","name":"Darklander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-12-27T10:59:29-08:00","id":1557049,"title":"","content":"Show biz provides some simple ideas for fronts. A theater troop, the character performers for an amusement park, a side show at a board walk, a &quot;haunted house&quot; attraction, in Hollywood of the past a poverty row film studio doing b-movies and adventure serials. Preferably something cheap, silly and gaudy. No one but those wanting to be entertained will pay attention","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-12-27T13:25:09-08:00","id":1557051,"title":"","content":"I have a murder mystery b&amp;b for my autumn court. What were your thoughts on Spring Court fronts I initially posted?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24961-darklander","name":"Darklander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-12-28T04:26:36-08:00","id":1557056,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darklander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1556850-mortal-fronts-for-changeling-courts?p=1557039#post1557039\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Would you be interested in my other Courts and their mundane covers? Also, do you consolidating it down helped?</div> </div> </div> </div>I am interested and I do think it helped, at the very least by putting more relevant characters in the same place where you can build up their relationships and conflicts.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-12-28T04:53:11-08:00","id":1557058,"title":"","content":"Here is my Summer Court. It is only two venues let me know what you think.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue 1: Firelords MC \u2013 The Flashpoint Bar and Grill (Kinzie Industrial Corridor / West Loop)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Description: A rowdy, high-glamour biker bar in Chicago that serves as the Summer Court\u2019s public face. It generates glamour from the &quot;Wrath&quot; of barroom brawls, the heat of the kitchen, and the intense social competition of the pool tables.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Color Scheme: Neon Orange, Soot Black, and Bright Yellow.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Leadership and Diplomacy</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Wildfire Jack Pyrrhos (Summer King)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Salamander, Elemental Seeming, Fireheart Kith, Greek)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: The Dapper Incinerator. He wears a black leather jacket with an orange lava crackle pattern, a yellow t-shirt, and leather pants with red-topped boots. A silver Greek meander ring symbolizes the eternal flow of Hellenic fire.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: His body heat is unnaturally high, making a handshake feel like a warm radiator. Surfaces he leans against remain hot, and he gives off a pleasant scent of cedar and smoke.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: Club President and Owner of The Crucible.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Road Role: The Point. He leads the formation, his bike\u2019s exhaust glowing white-hot, serving as the literal and metaphorical &quot;Fireheart&quot; guiding the pack.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: The Monarch (Summer King). He utilizes the Flame\u2019s Desires ability to lock eyes with a subject and learn their Aspirations.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: He possesses an intense mien surrounded by a flickering aura of flames and an illusory crown of fire. His skin is a vibrant golden-yellow with black markings.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Enforcement and Security</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Harold Hightower</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Giant, Ogre Seeming, Liminal Kith, British Isles)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: Ancient Hill-Fort Utility. He wears robust boots and a heavy duster. A tattoo of the White Horse of Uffington on his forearm represents his role as a guardian of thresholds.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: He speaks with a slow, deep drawl and is disproportionately tall. He leaves unnaturally deep and heavy boot prints in any ground he walks upon.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: Head Bouncer; controls access to the premises and the &quot;Low Court.&quot;</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Road Role: The Anchor. He rides at the rear of the formation, his massive bike acting as a physical barrier to prevent vehicles from merging into or interrupting the pack.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: The Threshold Guardian. He uses the Line in the Sand ability on thresholds.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: He is a massive, weathered mien that looks as though it were carved from ancient earth. His presence makes any doorway feel like an impassable fortress.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Razortooth Ray Redpath</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Redcap, Ogre Seeming, Gristlegrinder Kith, British Isles)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: Prickly Biker. He wears a red bandana, a black vest with a subtle orange lava-crackle pattern accenting the trim, and a Scotland thistle patch. Spiked wristbands and a skull-buckle belt complete his dangerous look.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: He is constantly chewing with an unsettling grinding noise. He appears to have traces of grime on his hands and face.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: Sergeant-at-Arms; responsible for bar security and &quot;fixing&quot; internal problems.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Road Role: The Enforcer. He rides &quot;wingman&quot; to the Monarch, ready to break formation to physically intercept threats or aggressive motorists.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: The Executioner. He uses the To Serve Man ability to unhinge his jaw, dealing lethal bite damage.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: He is a hunched, monstrous mien with jagged, razor-sharp teeth. His skin is a sallow gray, and his eyes glow a predatory red.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">S\u00e9raphine la Vip\u00e8re</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Viper Spirit, Beast Seeming, Venombite Kith, French)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: Parisian Viper-Chic. She wears sleek black leather with iridescent green accents and high-end rock-inspired tailoring.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: She has an unusually cold gaze and moves in fluid silence. Faint, almost invisible puncture marks are visible on her wrists or neck.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: VIP Hostess; handles targeted eliminations and deep-cover infiltration.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Road Role: The Ghost. She rides a silent, blackened sports bike, often splitting from the main pack to flank targets or disappear into side alleys for reconnaissance.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: The Viper. She uses the Deadly Bite ability to spend Glamour and inject targets with grave poison.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: She is a lithe, dangerous mien with skin that has a faint scaly texture. Her canines are elongated, and her eyes have vertical pupils.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Road Operations and Scouting</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Delphina Drakos</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Drakaina, Fairest Seeming, Draconic Kith, Greek)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: Hellenic Fire. She uses flashy club colors and bold Greek-inspired embroidery on high-end leather.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: She is exceptionally charismatic and gestural. She brings intense enthusiasm to every situation and speaks with a grand, theatrical tone.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: Communications Officer; maintains high-glamour morale among patrons.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Road Role: The Herald. She rides near the front, her bike emitting a rhythmic, booming exhaust that serves as a psychological warning to rivals.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: The Vital Spark. She uses the Majesty and None Dare Resist abilities to demand awe and strike fear into the hearts of rivals.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: She is a breathtaking draconic mien with iridescent golden scales along her throat and cheekbones. Her hair is a cascade of flickering plumes of flame.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Communications, Logistics, and Intelligence</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Foxy Lisa Reynard</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Fox Spirit, Beast Seeming, Picaroon Kith, French)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: Gallic Trickster. She wears a red motorcycle jacket under a black vest with a lava pattern, accented by an Eiffel Tower charm and a fox-tail accessory.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: She moves with cunning silence and has unusual amber eyes. She carries the musky scent of a wild animal.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: Floor Manager; manages club communications and tracks rival movements.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Road Role: The Signal. She manages the radio frequencies and encrypted comms for the pack, using her wits to confuse police scanners.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: The Spymaster. She uses the Dread Pirate ability to let her reputation ripple outward, penalizing those who try to oppose her.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: She is a sly mien with an auburn wavy bob and a foxlike fur pattern on her face. A vibrant orange tail emerges.</span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Road Operations and Scouting</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Elias Sunfeather</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Eagle Spirit, Beast Seeming, Airtouched Kith, Cax\u0161ep / Ho-Chunk)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: Plains Scout Utility. He wears tactical gear designed for climbing, featuring traditional Ho-Chunk geometric beadwork and ribbon-work motifs. These bold, angular patterns are integrated into his harness and goggles, marking him as a member of the Eagle Clan (Cax\u0161ep).</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: He constantly scans rooftops and high points rather than the ground. He has an uncanny sense of balance.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: Rooftop Lookout; observes the surrounding blocks for police or rival incursions, treating Chicago\u2019s steel canyons as the modern equivalent of the ancestral bluffs.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Road Role: The Eye. He doesn't ride with the pack; instead, he &quot;leaps&quot; between rooftops or uses The Drift to maintain a high-altitude visual on the pack\u2019s route.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: The Watcher. He uses The Drift to move across surfaces too fragile to hold his weight, mirroring the eagle's role as a divine messenger between worlds.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: He is a sharp-eyed avian mien whose arms transition into broad eagle wings. He possesses an intense, far-reaching gaze.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Thunderbird Johnny Thunderhawk</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Thunderbird, Elemental Seeming, Hunterheart Kith, Bod\u00e9wadmi / Potawatomi)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: Tactical Stalker. He wears dark earth tones and olive drab utilitarian gear with subtle Potawatomi floral quillwork. These asymmetrical designs feature Great Lakes motifs like the wild onion (shikaakwa), marking his gear as that of a local protector.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: He is highly perceptive, rarely missing a detail. The air carries a distant rumble like thunder when he is focused.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: Lead Scout; tracks threats and identifies resources in the Chicago Hedge, navigating the urban sprawl as the unceded marshland of his ancestors.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Road Role: The Tracker. He often rides several blocks ahead of the main pack, identifying police checkpoints or rival ambushes using a hunter's instinct for the local terrain.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: The Pathfinder. He uses the Pounce ability to spend Glamour and lock a target in place, mirroring the Thunderbird's role as the divine enforcer of the Great Lakes.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: Predatory avian mien with white electric eyes and massive storm-cloud wings.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Communications, Logistics, and Intelligence</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Solara Svetlova</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Firebird, Beast Seeming, Bright One Kith, Slavic)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: Firebird Radiant. She wears bright yellow and orange tops under her black cut. Her helmet features a custom Slavic Zhar-ptitsa decal.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: She radiates warmth and positive energy. Her skin has a natural glow, and she tends to be the center of attention in any room.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: Primary Messenger; ensures the King's word travels fast from The Crucible to the streets.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Road Role: The Flare. She rides a bike with a shimmering gold finish, acting as a visual beacon for the pack during night runs or heavy fog.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: The Beacon. She uses the Flare ability to turn her natural glow into a dazzling brilliance.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: She is an avian mien draped in feathers of pure molten gold and crimson. She leaves a trail of shimmering down behind her.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Club Services and Maintenance</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Andr\u00e9 \u201cthe Ravenous\u201d Boucher</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Ogre, Ogre Seeming, Gristlegrinder Kith, French)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: Butcher-Block Biker. He wears a heavy leather apron over his riding gear and carries bone-handled cleavers tucked into his belt.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: He always appears hungry and constantly snacks. He carries a faint smell of raw meat and iron, and his stomach emits deep rumbles.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: Kitchen Manager and Scavenger; ensures the club is fed and disposing of unwanted evidence.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Road Role: The Scavenger. He rides a trike with a massive storage trunk, used for collecting &quot;spoils&quot; of war or disposing of evidence on the fly.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: The Disposer. He utilizes the To Serve Man ability to spend Glamour and unhinge his jaw.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: He is a hulking mien with a distended stomach and a mouth filled with sharp, yellowed teeth.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue 2: Firelords MC \u2013 The Forge Garage (Kinzie Industrial Corridor / West Loop)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Description: A heavily fortified mechanical shop and private residential block located behind the bar. It generates glamour through the &quot;Toil&quot; of the forge, the heat of the machine, and the brotherhood of the road.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Color Scheme: Industrial Chrome, Lava Orange, and Molten Iron.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Leadership and Diplomacy</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Evelyn Ironside</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Sidhe Knight, Fairest Seeming, Chevalier Kith, British Isles)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: Refined High-Road Elegance. She wears a perfectly tailored black leather riding suit with equestrian lines. Her buckles feature etched Celtic knot patterns.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: Her posture is always perfectly straight and regal. She moves with an unnatural, liquid grace.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: Security Logistics Manager; organizes safe routes for club runs and compound defenses.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Road Role: The Captain. She rides alongside the Monarch, managing the formation\u2019s discipline and ensuring the pack remains a cohesive unit.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: The Strategic Enforcer. Her Rider\u2019s Call ability allows her to touch a vehicle and name it her Noble Steed.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: An effortlessly beautiful mien with enchanting eyes. Her leather suit subtly shimmers with compelling authority.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Enforcement and Security</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Dagny \u201cthe Valkyrie\u201d Valberg</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Valkyrie, Fairest Seeming, Valkyrie Kith, Norse)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: Norse War-Armor. Her gear mimics traditional Viking lamellar armor with stylized silver wing motifs and a Mjolnir pendant.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: She is always cold to the touch, and her steps are heavy and measured. The clink of her boots sounds resonant.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: War Chief; handles internal discipline and combat training drills for the knights.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Road Role: The Tactician. She analyzes rival formations in real-time, calling out weaknesses and directing the Enforcers to strike specific points.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: The Battle Strategist. She uses the Chooser of the Slain ability to spend Glamour to grant Inspired or Steadfast.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: Taller and muscled, with massive, feathered avian wings that shimmer with ethereal energy.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Communications, Logistics, and Intelligence</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Ember Weiss</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(White Woman, Fairest Seeming, Bright One Kith, German)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: Alpine Radiant. She wears agile, high-glamour white leather gear with gold highlights and Bavarian-style utility boots.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: She is exceptionally light on her feet. She appears to be standing in a spotlight even in darkness; her skin radiates a gentle heat.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: Residential Morale Officer; keeps spirits high among the knights and manages elite compound guests.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Road Role: The Weaver. She rides between the lanes, moving from the back of the pack to the front to deliver items or orders without the pack having to stop.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: The Firestarter. She uses the Flare ability to inspire allies or disorient foes with dazzling brilliance.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: A blindingly radiant woman with skin like white porcelain and eyes that burn like miniature suns.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Enforcement and Security</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Eldberg Logason</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Fire Giant, Ogre Seeming, Fireheart Kith, Norse)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: The Forge Worker. He wears a black leather vest over a shirtless torso and blue jeans. An iron-forged arm ring serves as a traditional Norse symbol.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: His clothes always appear slightly singed and covered in ash. He handles hot engine parts with his bare hands.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: Heavy Enforcer/The Wall; handles the manual labor of the compound forge.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Road Role: The Hammer. He rides a heavy, oversized cruiser. During physical confrontations, he uses the bike's sheer mass to ram vehicles off the path.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: The Pillar of Strength. He utilizes the Flame\u2019s Desires ability to spend Glamour and learn the Aspirations of those he confronts.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: A massive, mountainous mien with charcoal-gray skin and orange light glowing from deep fissures.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Petros \u201cColossus\u201d Sideris</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Gigas, Ogre Seeming, Gargantuan Kith, Greek)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: Spartan Tank. He wears heavy-duty gear with meander borders. A gold Spartan helmet patch is prominently embroidered on his vest.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: He possesses an unnatural physical density and is difficult to move. His clothes are always subtly stretched.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: Perimeter Guard; acts as a massive physical deterrent at the compound gates.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Road Role: The Dreadnought. He rides the largest bike in the club. His presence alone is a psychological weapon, as he takes up an entire lane of traffic.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: The Monster. He uses the Tower Over All ability to spend Glamour and add half his Wyrd to Size and Strength.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: A building-sized giant with bronze-colored skin and rock-hard muscle.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Peter Bergson</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Mountain Giant, Ogre Seeming, Stoneflesh Kith, Norse)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: Granite Ruggedness. He wears thick materials that look as though they were carved from stone. His braided beard is secured by a Norse rune-etched iron clasp.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: He is slow to anger but formidable once roused. His skin is hard like granite to the touch.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: The Warden; oversees all physical security and structural fortification protocols.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Road Role: The Wall. He rides in the middle of the pack. If ambushed, he is the first to drop his bike and form a stationary, stone-hard defensive line.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: The Durable Defender. He uses the Obdurate Skin ability to spend Glamour and harden his flesh.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: Skin solidifies into thick, gray mountain stone. His beard resembles mossy rock formations.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Ivan Zmeyevich</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Zmey, Ogre Seeming, Draconic Kith, Slavic)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: Dragon-Skin Tactical. He wears extra-heavy leather with a scale pattern and a dragon talisman on his belt. His buckle is shaped like a dragon\u2019s claw.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: He rarely blinks and stares with reptilian patience. His voice is a deep, brimstone-scented growl.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: The Dragon; stationary guardian for the club\u2019s treasury and hoarded assets.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Road Role: The Rear Guard. He rides alongside the Gatekeeper, watching the &quot;tail&quot; of the pack with predatory focus to prevent pursuit.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: The Guardian of the Hoard. He uses None Dare Resist to roar, inflicting the Frightened Condition.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: A hulking mien covered in thick, dark green scales. His jaw elongates into a snout.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Road Operations and Scouting</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Stormy Skye Sturm</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Storm Giantess, Ogre Seeming, Airtouched Kith, German)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: Storm Aviation. She wears a crop top under a leather jacket with molten lava patterns and a German Imperial Eagle pin on her collar.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: She carries the scent of rain and static electricity. The air around her is noticeably cooler.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: Leads the line on high-stakes runs and handles territorial disputes.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Road Role: The Vanguard. She rides at the very front of the scouting group, using her &quot;Storm&quot; aura to sense changes in weather or Hedge-currents ahead.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: The Vanguard Enforcer. She utilizes The Drift ability to move across fragile surfaces.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: Powerful mien with lavender skin and electric blue eyes. Static charges crackle along her gear.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Communications, Logistics, and Intelligence</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Svetlana \u201cthe Storm\u201d Groza</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Ala, Elemental Seeming, Levinquick Kith, Slavic)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: Slavic Storm-Tech. She wears tech-wear featuring stylized reflective perunic symbols and traditional Slavic embroidery.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: She is highly efficient and always on schedule. She is frequently found near electrical sources and checks her watch with impatient precision.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: Logistics Coordinator; ensures gear and club members move rapidly across Chicago.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Road Role: The Bolt. She uses Lightning Walk to &quot;jump&quot; ahead of the pack to clear traffic lights or sabotage rival vehicles before the MC arrives.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: The Quick-Change Artist. She uses the Lightning Walk ability to move resources instantly via the electrical grid.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: She has a sleek mien with a subtle electric hum surrounding her. Her eyes flash with white light.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Tsaahaa-e Lightning Serpent</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Lightning Serpent, Beast Seeming, Levinquick Kith, Nuu-chah-nulth)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: Urban Harpooner. Tech-wear with reflective Nuu-chah-nulth formline designs and a Haietlik-profile visor.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: She constantly monitors communications via an earpiece and types with unnatural speed while scanning for digital static.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: Club Hacker; manages digital security and cleans the club's forensic tracks.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Road Role: The Jammer. She carries portable digital scrambling gear on her bike, masking the pack\u2019s GPS and cellular signatures as they move.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: The Digital Courier. She uses Lightning Walk to dissolve into the electrical grid.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: Sinuous mien covered in iridescent scales that shimmer with electric blue light and a forked tongue.</span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Club Services and Maintenance</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Brock Eisenhauer</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Dwarf, Wizened Seeming, Artist Kith, German)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: Teutonic Craftsmanship. He wears heavy-duty workwear and forged metal club patches that blend mechanics with blacksmithing.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: Often covered in soot and metal shavings. His hands are heavily calloused; he remains intensely focused on his work.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: Shop Foreman/Weaponsmith; maintains the club's bikes and arms the court.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Road Role: The Tech. He rides a heavy utility bike loaded with tools. If a bike breaks down mid-run, he is the one who performs &quot;combat repairs&quot; to keep the pack moving.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: The Armorer. His Tools of the Trade ability allows him to manifest all necessary forge implements.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: He is a stocky, powerful mien with incredible muscle density, standing at a stout stature of less than five feet. His skin takes on a metallic, forged-iron sheen, and his eyes glow with the intensity of a forge fire.</span></span><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24961,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24961-darklander","user":"Darklander","date":". 12-28-2025, 09:33 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24961-darklander","name":"Darklander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-12-28T19:53:55-08:00","id":1557070,"title":"","content":"Two venues, but a lot more characters.<br /> <br /> Similar observations: you have good first descriptions for the places and people, now it's time to work on linking them with relationships and plot hooks, long term goals and interests. Again, you may benefit of reducing numbers, of characters this time, as 21 is a lot and can overwhelm you.<br /> <br /> But again, that's a very good starting point to establish a setting, colorful and visual.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-12-29T02:20:38-08:00","id":1557077,"title":"","content":"I had 21 with the spring court as well. What were your thoughts on the biker gang cover with the bar and garage/residential compound as venues and my choices for folklore inspirations for the characters? Also, I can submit my Autumn Court next which has 21 characters and 2 venues if you would like. Thanks for the feedback.<br /> <br /> Night Eyes Nick has Custom Kith to more accurately represent a Gargoyle.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Twilight's Embrace: A Victorian Murder Mystery B&amp;B</span> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Lincoln Park)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">The &quot;Twilight's Embrace&quot; is an eerie Victorian manor converted into a popular murder mystery bed and breakfast. It serves as the primary mundane front and central hub for the Chicago Autumn Court.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Proprietorship and Theatrical Leadership</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Donna Darkwater (Donna Ozerova) (Autumn Queen)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Rusalka, Elemental Seeming, Nightsinger Kith, Slavic)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: The Melancholy Monarch. She is draped in deep midnight blue and black velvet gowns with sea-foam green lace trimming, wearing an embroidered Ukrainian vyshyvanka blouse beneath her corset.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: She is always slightly damp or cool to the touch, and she leaves faint moisture rings on any surface she contacts.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: As the Musical Proprietor, she provides the haunting atmosphere for the B&amp;B's guests.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: The Monarch. She utilizes her Siren Song ability to root listeners to the spot with the Swooned Condition. Her Nightsinger Blessing ensures that when she uses Expression to sing or compose music for the Court, achieving three successes counts as an exceptional success.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: She possesses a beautiful but unsettling mien with perpetually damp hair like river weed. Her skin is pale and cold with a blue tint, and her legs may fuse into a fish tail or tentacles when she is submerged.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Night Eyes Nick Chatelain</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Gargoyle, Ogre Seeming, Gargoyle Kith, French)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: The Silent Sentinel. He is a stern presence in a sharp, dark black wool frock coat and waistcoat, accented by a gold &quot;watchman&quot; pin on his lapel.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: His skin is cold and exceptionally hard to the touch, and he occasionally displays subtle gray mottling under his jawline.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: He serves as the Enforcer and Head of Security for the manor. He is often found standing perfectly still on the balcony or rooftop, appearing to guests as a lifelike architectural detail until he &quot;wakes&quot; to intercept intruders.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: The Chancellor and Queen's Champion. He serves as the Arbiter of the Freehold\u2019s boundaries. He uses Line in the Sand to define the laws of the manor, ensuring those who violate the Queen's peace find themselves magically lost within the Victorian corridors. His Gargoyle\u2019s Grace ensures that when he defends a specific person, place, or boundary using Athletics or Intimidation, achieving three successes counts as an exceptional success.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: He possesses a muscular form with skin like pitted gray granite that is cold and rigid to the touch. His eyes glow with a cold, pale light, and sharp claws extend from his fingertips. Large, leathery wings, which resemble dark bat wings carved entirely from rough stone, are folded against his back. When his sentinel powers are active, his mien becomes entirely monochrome, and his stony wings unfurl to their full, terrifying span as he takes to the air to enforce his decree.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">The Guard and Grounds-Keeping</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Ragnar Stonefist (Ragnar Stenberg)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Troll, Ogre Seeming, Stoneflesh Kith, Norse)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: The Immovable Norseman. He wears sturdy dark denim Victorian-era working clothes and a leather wrist cuff with a carved silver Valknut symbol.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: His skin has a perpetually dusty appearance, and his muscle definition is unnaturally rigid like sculpted rock.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: He acts as the Bouncer and Physical Plant Manager for the property.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: The Treasurer. He uses Obdurate Skin to spend Glamour and divide successes between Armor, Resolve, and Composure. His Stoneflesh Blessing ensures that when he uses his physical presence for Intimidation, achieving three successes counts as an exceptional success.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: He is a large, muscular mien with rough, gray skin resembling natural earth. His brows are heavy, and he has gnarled bony protrusions on his knuckles.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Silvester Bock</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Bockman, Beast Seeming, Liminal Kith, German)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: The Precise Doorman. He wears a 3-piece suit in dark brown tweed with a crimson cravat and a carved goat-head pin.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: He has a stiff gait, and his boots make a distinct &quot;click-clack&quot; sound like hooves on the floor.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: He serves as the primary Gatekeeper for the manor.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: The Doorwarden. He uses Line in the Sand to set threshold conditions that inflict the Lost Condition on violators. His Liminal Blessing ensures that when he uses Survival or Streetwise to navigate, achieving three successes counts as an exceptional success.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: He is a sturdy mien with thick, curled goat horns. His legs end in cloven hooves, and his skin is covered in patches of rough goat hair.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">One-Eyed Jack Petridis</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Cyclops, Ogre Seeming, Cyclopean Kith, Greek)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: The Singular Laborer. He wears durable dark duster jackets and a formal black silk eye patch.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: His remaining eye has incredible focus and never blinks, and he carries a faint, metallic scent of copper.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: He is the manor's Repairman and General Laborer.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: The Hunter and Tracker. He uses Smell the Blood to spend Glamour and learn a target\u2019s weakest points, upgrading damage to lethal. His Cyclopean Blessing ensures that when using Investigation to track fae creatures, achieving three successes counts as an exceptional success.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: He is an imposing figure with a single, massive eye in the center of his forehead that gleams with intense focus. His skin is rough and scarred like weathered stone.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Intelligence, Espionage, and Theatrical Infiltration</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Tybalt \u201cThe King of Cats\u201d Cattanach</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Cat Sidhe, Beast Seeming, Riddleseeker Kith, British Isles)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: The Feline Gentleman. He is impeccably dressed in Edwardian dark greens and black, featuring a gold pocket watch and a Scottish thistle lapel pin.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: He is meticulously clean and lands silently on his feet, possessing unnervingly large golden irises.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: He acts as the Chief Investigator and Head Servant for the guests. In the Murder Mystery play, he acts as the Lead Detective.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: The Investigator and Spymaster. He utilizes Neck Riddle to force targets to resolve conflicts with riddles. His Riddleseeker Blessing ensures that when he uses Investigation to solve a puzzle or uncover a hidden truth, achieving three successes counts as an exceptional success.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: He is a humanoid cat covered in sleek black fur with a single white patch on his chest. He possesses a long, twitching tail and predatory golden eyes.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Ermis \u201cPandemos\u201d Dionysiou</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Kobalos, Darkling Seeming, Mirrorskin Kith, Greek)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: The Shapeshifting Role-Player. He adopts whatever uniform his current task requires and carries an obsidian worry stone.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: People instantly forget his face or voice the moment he leaves the room, and he appears exceptionally bland when he is not in character.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: He is the manor's resident Actor and Master of Disguise.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: The Spy and Infiltrator. He uses Mercurial Visage to mold his Mask and Mien into composite identities. His Mirrorskin Blessing ensures that when he uses Stealth while in disguise, achieving three successes counts as an exceptional success.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: His mien is a generic, forgettable blur that resembles a featureless humanoid form, acting as a blank canvas for his transformations.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Sam \u201cSilverwing\u201d Pyawasay</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Bat Spirit, Beast Seeming, Lullescent Kith, Mamaceqtaw / Menominee)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: The Silent Listener. He wears simple dark valet clothes accented with subtle Menominee woodland floral beadwork. Hanging from his belt is a small wooden bat charm, hand-carved in the traditional Menominee style from local cedar to serve as a spiritual focus.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: He moves in total silence and flinches at sharp noises, possessing acute hearing that allows him to hear whispers from rooms away. He always seems to be mid-shrug and wears a persistent, knowing smile, as if he\u2019s just heard a really good joke at your expense.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: He works as the Eavesdropper and Information Gatherer for the manor. He follows his targets like a shadow and never makes a sound\u2014except in private, humming the freehold\u2019s secrets like a beloved lullaby.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: The Watchman and Intelligencer. He uses Song of Silence to navigate via echolocation and unveil magically hidden objects or beings. His Lullescent Blessing ensures that when he uses Stealth to eavesdrop on a target, achieving three successes counts as an exceptional success.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: He features oversized pointed ears and a flattened nose. Large leathery wings are folded against his back, and his eyes are small and milky. A light coating of gray fur covers him, with a peach hue climbing up his throat.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Diplomacy, Allurement, and Theatrical Design</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Nocturna (Nora M\u00f6rk)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Dark Elf, Fairest Seeming, Shadowsoul Kith, Norse)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: The Gothic Elf. She is draped in flowing black velvet and sheer silk with deep violet jewelry and a silver Nauthiz rune pendant.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: Her eyes are darker than humanly possible, and she avoids bright lights, operating efficiently only after sundown.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: She is the manor\u2019s Interior Designer and Atmosphere Specialist.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: The Emissary. She uses Nightblind to inflict the Blindness Condition on targets via a touch. Her Shadowsoul Blessing grants her a bonus to mundane Subterfuge rolls equal to her Wyrd and the 8-again rule, aiding in courtly deceptions.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: She is elegantly slender with ash-white skin and long, pointed ears. She radiates a faint, cold aura of shadow that swallows nearby light.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Maeve \u201cLeann\u00e1n\u201d Lennon</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Leann\u00e1n s\u00eddhe, Fairest Seeming, Lamia Kith, British Isles)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: The Alluring Muse. She wears a seductive crimson and black Victorian evening gown with a high collar and a silver Claddagh ring.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: She has flawless skin with a cold, pale luminescence, and mortals find it physically difficult to look away from her.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: She serves as the manor\u2019s Concierge and Hostess.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: The Muse and Recruiter. She uses Devouring Touch to drain the essence of those she seduces, binding them to the Court. Her Lamia Blessing ensures that when she uses Persuasion to seduce or manipulate a target, achieving three successes counts as an exceptional success.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: She has a devastatingly beautiful but icy mien that radiates an aura of perfection. Her features are flawless but alien, evoking a sense of predatory grace.</span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Corbin \u201cKoyah\u201d Blackfeather</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Raven Spirit, Beast Seeming, Picaroon Kith, Haida)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: The Dread Showman. He wears an impeccable midnight-black suit with silver buttons and a cravat pin featuring an intricate Haida Raven carving.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: He possesses an unnerving, predatory charm; his laughter is sharp, and his gaze feels like it is &quot;counting&quot; the valuables on your person.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: He is the Game Master and Murder Mystery Villain. He acts as the &quot;Closer,&quot; emerging only after Tybalt's riddles have been solved to provide the final emotional payoff.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: The Liaison and Strategic Shield. He uses his Dread Pirate aura to socially paralyze external threats and rivals. His Picaroon Blessing ensures that when he uses Weaponry or Expression, achieving three successes counts as an exceptional success.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: He is a lithe mien with an elongated face resembling a raven's beak, and iridescent black feathers cover his skin.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Domestic Care, Preservation, and Lethal Arts</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Alphena &quot;The Night Hag&quot; Nacht </span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Mara, Darkling Seeming, Leechfinger Kith, German)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: The Silent Chronicler. She wears severe 1880s black silk mourning dresses with jet beads and a stylized German knot of protection.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: Her hands are dry and cool with very long fingers, and guests often feel a physical chill when she passes them.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: She is the Housekeeper and Wellness Check Attendant.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: The Chronicler. She uses Sap the Vital Spark to drain health via physical contact to heal herself. Her Leechfinger Blessing ensures that when she uses Medicine to determine the health of a potential target, achieving three successes counts as an exceptional success.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: She is a gaunt, skeletal mien with dark, hollow eyes. She appears ethereal and often floats slightly off the ground with long, dark talons.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Ophelia \u201cSybaris\u201d Drakos</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Lamia, Beast Seeming, Lamia Kith, Greek)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: The Compassionate Nurse. She wears a severe Victorian nurse\u2019s uniform in grey with a silver Ophis brooch on the collar.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: Her touch can be restorative or draining, and she keeps her forearms wrapped in bandages at all times.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: She acts as the primary Nurse and Caretaker for the manor.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: The Caretaker and Executioner. She uses Devouring Touch to drain lethal damage from mortals or supernatural energy from peers. Her Lamia Blessing ensures that when she uses Persuasion to manipulate targets, achieving three successes counts as an exceptional success.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: She possesses a breathtakingly beautiful upper half that tapers into a long, powerful serpentine tail. Her speech is punctuated by the flick of a slender, forked tongue.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Sarah \u201cWeb-Weaver\u201d Wak\u0105nuzi</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Spider Spirit, Beast Seeming, Venombite Kith, Wak\u0105nuzira / Ho-Chunk)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: The Weaver of Plots. She wears a tight-laced black satin bodice and a voluminous skirt with silver web jewelry. Her attire is accented with traditional Ho-Chunk applique ribbon-work along the hem, featuring sharp, symmetrical geometric patterns in silver and charcoal that mirror the complex architecture of a web.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: She has extremely long fingers that move with uncanny speed, allowing her to repair clothing seams in the blink of an eye.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: She serves as the manor\u2019s Seamstress.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: The Assassin and Intrigue Master. She employs her Deadly Bite to inject victims with a grave poison that deals lethal damage. Her Venombite Blessing ensures that when she uses Brawl to grapple a target, achieving three successes counts as an exceptional success.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: She has a disturbing form with elongated limbs and four spider legs emerging from her back. She possesses multi-faceted eyes and fangs dripping with toxin.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">The Black Tide Curios: An Occult &amp; Nautical Antique Shop</span> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Edgewater)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Description: A chaotic antique shop near the Chicago port specializing in maritime and occult curios, serving as a front for Autumn Court waterway operations.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Proprietorship and Nautical Defense</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Duglas Darkwater (Duglas Ozerov) </span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Vodyanoi, Ogre Seeming, Swimmerskin Kith, Slavic)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: The Stoic Captain. He is a bulky man in a salt-stained midnight blue peacoat over rough black trousers and a shirt with a Slavic knot pattern.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: He has gloved, webbed fingers, and his skin is always clammy, smelling faintly of rust and lake water.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: He is the Proprietor and Manager of the shop.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: The Chancellor and Watermaster. He uses The Selkie\u2019s Skin to switch between air and water breathing. His Swimmerskin Blessing ensures that when he rolls Brawl to grapple someone in the water or ambush from the water, achieving three successes counts as an exceptional success.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: He has a powerful mien with matted green pond-scum hair and a beard. His skin is bloated and bluish, and his hands are heavily webbed.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Baba Sofia Babich </span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Hag (Baba), Ogre Seeming, Witchtooth Kith, Slavic)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: The Formidable Landlady. She wears a crimson and gold embroidered vest over a black dress with traditional Eastern European folk motifs.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: She has a sharp, intimidating gaze and unnervingly strong hands, with teeth that are visibly sharp and jagged.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: She acts as the Landlord and Security Chief for the shop area.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: The Guardian. She uses Nibble, Nibble, Little Mouse to reshape the land within a square mile to terrify stragglers. Her Witchtooth Blessing ensures that when she targets a mortal with Intimidation, achieving three successes counts as an exceptional success.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: She is a hunched, ancient mien with a hooked nose and a wide mouth filled with iron-like teeth. Her eyes gleam with predatory intelligence.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Acquisition, Recovery, and Subaquatic Salvage</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Pondscum Peggy Marsh</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Grindylow, Ogre Seeming, Swimmerskin Kith, British Isles)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: The Ragged Salvager. She wears layers of thick, ragged green and black skirts with a rusty English anchor charm.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: She has a perpetually hunched posture and carries a smell of stagnant mud and water.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: She is the Salvage Buyer and Inventory Manager.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: The Collector. She utilizes The Selkie\u2019s Skin to fuse her legs into aquatic appendages and swim at double speed. His Swimmerskin Blessing ensures that when he uses Brawl to grapple threats in the water, achieving three successes counts as an exceptional success.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: She is a squat mien with slimy, moss-colored skin and bulging yellow eyes. She possesses sharp fangs and webbed hands with short claws.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Maurice \u201cAnkou\u201d le Faucheur</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Ankou, Darkling Seeming, Gravewight Kith, French)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: The Somber Appraiser. He is tall and gaunt in immaculate black evening wear with a silver skull tie pin.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: He appears entirely colorless, and mortals instinctively give him a wide berth and feel a physical chill.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: He serves as the shop\u2019s Appraiser and Restoration Specialist.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: The Herald and Mortician. He uses Charnel Sight to see and hear ghosts lingering in Twilight. His Gravewight Blessing ensures that when he uses Intimidation to influence someone with his physical presence, achieving three successes counts as an exceptional success.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: He is a skeletal, colorless mien in spectral robes. His face is a bare skull, and he carries an aura that forces ghosts to manifest clearly.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Saga \u201cRuna\u201d Falk</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Volva, Wizened Seeming, Oracle Kith, Norse)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: The Ancient Seer. She is an ancient-looking woman in layered black and violet skirts who appears to be burdened by the paths of the Wyrd.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: Her movements are punctuated by trancelike freezes, and her hands are permanently scarred from occult rituals.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: She acts as the shop\u2019s Fortune Teller and High-Stakes Consultant.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: The Grand Oracle. She uses Runecasting via bone and iron as a Foretelling ritual, spending Glamour to ask three questions about the future or gain the Informed Condition. Her Oracle Blessing ensures that when she uses Occult to understand unusual phenomena, achieving three successes counts as an exceptional success.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: She appears incredibly wizened with parchment-like skin covered in runic symbols that glow with a sickly violet light when she speaks of destiny.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Hostess and Survey Operations</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Lorelei Rhine</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Nixie, Beast Seeming, Nightsinger Kith, German)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: The Singing Saleswoman. She is dressed in midnight blue silk with a silver German lyre necklace.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: Her voice has a hypnotic quality, and she has very sharp, slightly pointed canine teeth.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: She serves as the Shop Hostess and primary Saleswoman.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: The Emissary and Socialite. She employs Siren Song to root listeners to the spot with the Swooned Condition. Her Nightsinger Blessing ensures that when she uses Expression to sing or compose music, achieving three successes counts as an exceptional success.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: She is a stunningly beautiful mien with waterfall-like hair and pale skin. Her voice resonates with an enchanting quality, and her teeth are distinctly sharp.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Ondine Nocturne (Vesper L\u2019Eau)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">(Undine, Elemental Seeming, Asrai Kith, Gaulish Celt/French)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Individual Aesthetic: The Liquid Ghost. She is reserved in form-fitting black silks with a silver anchor brooch.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Mundane Mask Tells: She has no pulse, and a small puddle of clear water forms at her feet if she stands still too long.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Venue Role: She acts as the shop's Acquisition Specialist. She retrieves &quot;lost&quot; artifacts from inaccessible locations like municipal pipes or submerged safes.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Court Role: The Infiltrator. She uses Watery Form to dissolve and bypass physical security via water infrastructure. Her Asrai Blessing ensures that when she uses Stealth or Athletics while in the Hedge, achieving three successes counts as an exceptional success.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Fae Mien: She is a shimmering silhouette of liquid moonlight with skin like deep-sea bioluminescence. Her deep eyes hold the depth of an ocean.</span></span><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24961,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24961-darklander","user":"Darklander","date":". 12-30-2025, 06:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24961-darklander","name":"Darklander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-01-06T00:04:38-08:00","id":1557329,"title":"","content":"I'm sorry, those days I've been too sick and too little energy, I don't know when I'll be able to devote the attention this demands.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-01-06T06:24:36-08:00","id":1557343,"title":"","content":"No rush, get well soon","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24961-darklander","name":"Darklander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"102"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}